'''Boneblade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a cutlass shaped blade with nine gray scratch marks all over it: three by the tip, two vertical marks by the ricasso, and four more horizontal marks also by the ricasso. Two triangle bits of the blade have been chipped off. The handle is made out of black bones with a red grip attached to it.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/1868405032/Captain-Bonegrim-Sword Captain Bonegrim Sword], the sword that comes with the [https://www.roblox.com/bundles/6/Captain-Bonegrim Captain Bonegrim] bundle.
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Boneblade]], which was found in the same box.
*It was in the first holiday [[Boxes|box]] to feature [[knives]] and [[guns]] in the box.
*Unlike most weapons, it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
